  "description": "With the death of his grandfather, Jihoo stands to inherit his company—and a massive amount of wealth. There’s just one catch: he must spend a year with “the person he loves.” But for Jihoo, that’s complicated. Not only did that person, Eun-yul, leave him five years ago, but now she has a kid! Can Jihoo push through years of hard feelings and awkwardness to win her back? Is he really just doing it for the company?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
